# Additional Terms Applicable to QEMU-MCP

## 1. QEMU Exception

QEMU-MCP references QEMU (https://www.qemu.org/) for virtual machine
execution. QEMU is licensed under GPL v2 or later (some components
under LGPL). This program does not bundle QEMU binaries; users must
provide their own QEMU installation. The QEMU license obligations
apply only to the QEMU binaries, not to this program.

## 2. Cryptographic Notice

This program uses the cryptography library (cryptography.io) which
is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The Fernet symmetric
encryption and PBKDF2 key derivation used by the credential store
are provided by that library. See the cryptography library's license
for full terms.

